<p>One or more Chemotion file-storage tiers are unavailable:</p>

<ul>
  <% @problems.each do |problem| %>
    <li><%= problem %></li>
  <% end %>
</ul>

<p>
  Archived files on an unavailable tier cannot be read until it is restored.
  Please check that each tier's folder exists and is writable — for a cold tier,
  confirm its <code>:cold</code> path in <code>config/shrine.yml</code> (and any
  mount behind it) is present.
</p>
